---
import TechStack from '../../components/TechStack.astro'
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'

const title = '关于'
const description = '关于 MongoRolls：前端工程师，关注工程化、开源与个人写作。'
const headings = [
  {
    depth: 2,
    slug: 'about-site',
    text: '关于本站',
  },
  {
    depth: 2,
    slug: 'about-me',
    text: '关于我',
  },
  {
    depth: 3,
    slug: 'about-me-footprint',
    text: '足迹',
  },
  {
    depth: 3,
    slug: 'about-me-contact',
    text: '联系方式',
  },
  {
    depth: 3,
    slug: 'about-me-final',
    text: 'final',
  },
]
---

<BaseLayout
  title={title}
  headings={headings}
  description={description}
>
    <article data-pagefind-body class="prose dark:prose-invert max-w-none">
    <h1 class="sr-only" data-pagefind-meta="title">{title}</h1>
    <h2 id="about-site">关于本站</h2>

    <p>经过多个方案比较，最后选定</p>
    <p>本站基于 <a class="post-link" href="https://astro.build/">Astro</a> 框架，然后再进行 diy 创作。</p>
    <p>评论区采用 <a class="post-link" href="https://twikoo.js.org/">Twikoo</a>，连接 MongoDB。</p>
    <p>都部署于 <a class="post-link" href="https://vercel.com/">Vercel</a>。</p>

    <h2 id="about-me" class="flex items-center align-center"><span class="mr-2 font-bold text-[#425bc5] text-3xl">#</span>关于我</h2>

    <ul>
      <li>👋  I'm Mongorolls</li>
      <li>🔭  a Front-end development engineer</li>
      <li>🌱  currently working on NetEase</li>
      <li>✨  want to be a open source developer</li>
    </ul>

    <div class="my-8 sm:my-16">
      <p>技术栈</p>
      <TechStack />
    </div>

    <h3 id="about-me-footprint">🗺️ 足迹</h3>
    <ul>
      <li>工作与生活足迹持续更新中。</li>
    </ul>

    <h3 id="about-me-contact">📫 touch me</h3>

    <ul>
      <li>github: <a href="https://github.com/MongoRolls">MongoRolls</a></li>
    </ul>


    <h3 id="about-me-final">Final</h3>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>

<style scoped>
    p,h3 {
        white-space: break-spaces;
    }
</style>
